Subject: [PATCH] debug panel: Ctrl+F1 opens the runtime debugger

F1 alone is left to the port: the Transformers port draws its mod menu there
(through the debug UI callbacks, with the same ImGui).

diff --git a/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_debug_panel.cpp b/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_debug_panel.cpp
index c9aa2c6..f5a5d65 100644
--- a/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_debug_panel.cpp
+++ b/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_debug_panel.cpp
@@ -2206,7 +2206,8 @@ void PS2DebugPanel::draw(PS2Runtime &runtime)
         return;
     }
 
-    if (IsKeyPressed(KEY_F1))
+    // Ctrl+F1: F1 alone is the game's mod menu (a port's debug UI callback draws it).
+    if (IsKeyPressed(KEY_F1) && (IsKeyDown(KEY_LEFT_CONTROL) || IsKeyDown(KEY_RIGHT_CONTROL)))
     {
         toggleVisible();
     }
